{"version":1,"content":"<p>人工智能究竟會在多大程度上改變人類社會？Anthropic內部一名負責AI安全防護的研究人員給出了一個相當激進的預測：到2027年底，人工智能可能在幾乎所有專業領域超越人類頂尖專家，而隨着這種能力逐漸擴展到整個經濟體系，人類甚至可能最終失去通過勞動獲得收入的能力，成為永久無法就業的羣體。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587310.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:04:29.252745+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:39:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:57:39.011343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:57:39.011343+00:00","content_hash":"4f740eb140cb53cf3485b9294f95822bdbf678292219bb460e12728ac7013453","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}